# Feature name: duration_to_credit_ratio
# Feature description: Ratio of the loan's duration to the total credit amount.
# Usefulness: This feature measures how spread out the repayment period is relative to the loan size. Longer repayment periods for equivalent loan amounts could indicate higher risk due to extended financial obligations.
df['duration_to_credit_ratio'] = df['duration'] / (df['credit_amount'] + 1e-9)
end

